* Test Cases
  * Process
    1. It should not run 2 daemon.
    2. It should clean up lock file after terminating.

  * Sync
    1. It should start syncing when local file is updated.
    2. It should start syncing when remote file is updated.
    3. It should download .syncignore from remote when the file is newer than local before start syncing.
    4. It should not start syncing when the updated file is listed in .syncignore.
    5. It should run sync if file is updated while syncing.

  * Port forwarding
    1. It should be able to forward the local request to remote container
    2. It should open one socket for one container
